    <section xml:id="sec-section-2-1">
      <title>Section 12 - Introduction to Vector-Valued Functions</title>
      <objectives>
  <p><em>Learning Objectives</em></p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Interpret a vector-valued function as a parametric curve in two- or three-dimensional space.
    </li>
    <li>
      Recognize common parametric curves and describe their geometric shapes based on the component functions.
    </li>
  </ul>
</objectives>

